1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Forty-Fourth Episode
The Snow Eagle
The Screaming White Eagle

15
00:02:15,930 --> 00:02:16,993
How about this, Doctor?

16
00:02:17,310 --> 00:02:19,749
Come on, it's your turn. Go ahead!

17
00:02:22,389 --> 00:02:25,079
Doctor, I said it's your turn.

18
00:02:25,263 --> 00:02:29,458
Forgive me. Well, that was a fine move.

19
00:02:29,482 --> 00:02:31,533
Now, how's this?

20
00:02:31,923 --> 00:02:33,292
I see, I see.

21
00:02:34,489 --> 00:02:37,133
Then I'll go like this. How about that, Doctor?

22
00:02:38,370 --> 00:02:39,378
Strange.

23
00:02:39,642 --> 00:02:41,098
What's wrong with the Doctor today?

24
00:02:41,502 --> 00:02:43,899
He's usually so absorbed, but his mind is completely elsewhere.

25
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,080
Doctor!

26
00:02:47,019 --> 00:02:49,406
It was my turn, wasn't it? Let's see...

27
00:02:49,838 --> 00:02:50,425
Doctor,

28
00:02:50,456 --> 00:02:52,152
let's stop playing chess.

29
00:02:52,176 --> 00:02:52,932
Come on,

30
00:02:52,956 --> 00:02:56,260
something's bothering you, isn't it? Tell me what it is.

31
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:59,651
No, it's really something trivial, but it's bugging me.

32
00:03:00,049 --> 00:03:04,020
Look at the heavy snow outside—that snow is what's worrying me.

33
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:14,878
According to the records, it's the heaviest snowfall in 100 years.

34
00:03:14,902 --> 00:03:16,617
So what about it?

35
00:03:16,642 --> 00:03:18,320
That is the problem.

36
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,893
Lord Sapphire, after a heavy snow like this,

37
00:03:22,917 --> 00:03:25,200
an ill-omened white eagle is sure to appear.

38
00:03:25,790 --> 00:03:27,353
An ill-omened white eagle?

39
00:03:28,730 --> 00:03:31,187
Indeed. They say when it arrives with the heavy snow

40
00:03:31,211 --> 00:03:35,500
<i>and covers the kingdom with its giant wings, misfortune falls upon the land.</i>

41
00:03:38,173 --> 00:03:42,073
Is that what was bothering you? That's just a superstition.

42
00:03:42,246 --> 00:03:43,456
I am a scholar myself.

43
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:47,169
I don't fear superstition, but history.

44
00:03:47,193 --> 00:03:51,189
In the past, whenever our kingdom faced invasion, there was always...

45
00:03:53,987 --> 00:03:56,000
Doctor, what was that sound just now?

46
00:03:59,700 --> 00:04:03,580
Lord Sapphire... that bad omen I just spoke of is already...

47
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:31,860
Lord Sapphire, the ominous white eagle has indeed appeared.

48
00:04:32,788 --> 00:04:36,286
I'm more concerned about last night's sound, Doctor.

49
00:04:36,620 --> 00:04:37,869
Sapphire!

50
00:04:38,333 --> 00:04:39,589
Sapphire!

51
00:04:39,613 --> 00:04:41,080
Come on down!

52
00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:43,782
Let's build a snowman and play!

53
00:04:43,860 --> 00:04:46,040
Hang on! I'm coming!

54
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:47,960
<i>Pat-pat-pat...</i>

55
00:04:49,036 --> 00:04:50,700
Sapphire look, it's done!

56
00:04:51,905 --> 00:04:54,060
How is it? Pretty good, right?

57
00:04:55,250 --> 00:04:57,540
It's so-so. But what is it supposed to be?

58
00:04:57,825 --> 00:05:01,374
Ahem! The champion of justice, Ribbon Knight!

59
00:05:01,540 --> 00:05:02,960
That's mean, Sapphire!

60
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,500
You're the mean one, Tink!

61
00:05:04,850 --> 00:05:08,780
The Ribbon Knight is much more slender and stylish than that!

62
00:05:11,015 --> 00:05:13,865
Haha, you fell down!

63
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:14,923
Hey!

64
00:05:15,020 --> 00:05:16,020
It's Franz!

65
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:17,520
Did you say Franz?

66
00:05:17,945 --> 00:05:19,023
Hey!

67
00:05:20,910 --> 00:05:22,300
Hello! Welcome!

68
00:05:22,977 --> 00:05:24,232
It's been a while since we had nice weather.

69
00:05:24,381 --> 00:05:25,197
Hello, Tink!

70
00:05:25,545 --> 00:05:26,950
Hello, Franz!

71
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:31,709
So, what were you making? Come on, let me join in!

72
00:05:34,597 --> 00:05:35,394
Is it that one?

73
00:05:36,290 --> 00:05:38,240
It's me! That snowman is me!

74
00:05:38,517 --> 00:05:39,580
Can you tell?

75
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:41,879
Of course. It's very well made.

76
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:43,920
Where's yours? You don't have one.

77
00:05:44,460 --> 00:05:45,886
I know, I'll make one of you!

78
00:05:46,710 --> 00:05:49,260
I'd better take the hint and leave them be.

79
00:05:52,487 --> 00:05:54,771
Wow, it's so pretty.

80
00:05:55,202 --> 00:05:56,853
It feels like I'm back in Heaven.

81
00:05:58,228 --> 00:06:01,663
It's like standing in a huge field of white flowers.

82
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:08,091
I'm sure I heard something...

83
00:06:42,290 --> 00:06:46,776
Mister, pull yourself together! Come on, mister, speak to me!

84
00:06:48,696 --> 00:06:49,560
He's coming around.

85
00:06:50,830 --> 00:06:52,350
Are you from Silverland?

86
00:06:53,077 --> 00:06:54,951
Take me to the castle.

87
00:06:54,975 --> 00:06:58,765
X is coming. X-Union, with a terrifying weapon.

88
00:07:02,350 --> 00:07:04,065
Yours turned out better after all.

89
00:07:04,970 --> 00:07:06,900
No, Franz, yours is...

90
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:10,040
Look at that!

91
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:15,709
Sapphire, I didn't just come over to play.

92
00:07:15,733 --> 00:07:17,895
I was worried about this strange noise...

93
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,092
Could it be...

94
00:07:19,303 --> 00:07:22,185
Sapphire! This is terrible!

95
00:07:25,740 --> 00:07:30,234
It's terrible! X-Union has reached the Orange Forest!

96
00:07:31,015 --> 00:07:33,540
They have some kind of terrifying, unknown weapon!

97
00:07:33,930 --> 00:07:35,940
The border guard has been wiped out!

98
00:07:36,492 --> 00:07:37,492
- What?!
- What?!

99
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:44,693
Sapphire, this sound could be X's new weapon.

100
00:07:44,825 --> 00:07:47,010
I'm going to scout the Orange Forest right away.

101
00:07:47,205 --> 00:07:48,205
Care to join?

102
00:07:49,555 --> 00:07:50,886
Tink, lead the way!

103
00:07:51,586 --> 00:07:54,005
Wait for me, Sapphire!

104
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:14,340
Tink, are you sure it's around here?

105
00:08:14,370 --> 00:08:16,540
No doubt about it, it's definitely around here.

106
00:08:17,060 --> 00:08:19,288
But there isn't a soul in sight.

107
00:08:20,590 --> 00:08:23,506
Franz, don't you feel like someone is watching us?

108
00:08:39,539 --> 00:08:42,233
Now that you mention it, there is a strange presence...

109
00:08:46,139 --> 00:08:47,139
Watch out!

110
00:08:48,689 --> 00:08:50,017
Who's there? Show yourself!

111
00:08:53,139 --> 00:08:54,831
We are X's scouts!

112
00:08:55,199 --> 00:08:56,472
You shall not pass!

113
00:08:56,793 --> 00:08:57,528
Get them!

114
00:09:04,910 --> 00:09:05,644
Sapphire!

115
00:09:05,855 --> 00:09:06,394
Franz!

116
00:09:09,980 --> 00:09:10,777
Take that!

117
00:09:12,949 --> 00:09:13,778
Nice one, Tink!

118
00:09:22,145 --> 00:09:23,635
X!

119
00:09:24,995 --> 00:09:26,054
Retreat!

120
00:09:27,909 --> 00:09:29,057
They're getting away!

121
00:09:31,009 --> 00:09:32,840
You'll regret this day!

122
00:09:34,659 --> 00:09:38,580
I'll give you a real treat. Just sit tight and wait!

123
00:09:42,459 --> 00:09:44,673
Sapphire, this is a bit strange...

124
00:09:59,569 --> 00:10:00,300
Sapphire!

125
00:10:00,514 --> 00:10:01,034
Sapphire!

126
00:10:01,058 --> 00:10:02,580
Franz! Over here!

127
00:10:03,110 --> 00:10:03,953
Are you hurt?

128
00:10:04,979 --> 00:10:06,980
I'm fine!

129
00:10:07,660 --> 00:10:08,660
Get down!

130
00:10:22,542 --> 00:10:23,300
An eagle!

131
00:10:23,469 --> 00:10:24,880
That ominous eagle just screeched!

132
00:10:30,316 --> 00:10:31,720
That's ridiculous! Come on!

133
00:10:35,676 --> 00:10:38,030
Wait, Franz! We're coming too!

134
00:10:58,300 --> 00:10:59,320
Prepare to fire!

135
00:11:08,876 --> 00:11:09,720
Fire!

136
00:11:18,806 --> 00:11:21,914
Silverland's castle walls are like scrap paper!

137
00:11:22,426 --> 00:11:23,113
Move out!

138
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:53,653
Don't falter! We will crush Silverland in one fell swoop!

139
00:12:06,739 --> 00:12:08,951
So that was what caused the scream.

140
00:12:09,105 --> 00:12:12,320
If a giant cannon like that crosses the border, we'll be in serious trouble.

141
00:12:12,505 --> 00:12:13,920
We have to stop them somehow.

142
00:12:14,889 --> 00:12:17,360
That's right, we must stop them ourselves, no matter what!

143
00:12:24,129 --> 00:12:25,780
Sapphire, do you have a plan?

144
00:12:27,359 --> 00:12:28,175
Look over there!

145
00:12:29,051 --> 00:12:31,340
Let's bring down the bridge over that border river!

146
00:12:32,014 --> 00:12:32,425
Look!

147
00:12:32,668 --> 00:12:35,230
The side with the border guard armory wasn't destroyed!

148
00:12:35,535 --> 00:12:36,973
There must be gunpowder there!

149
00:12:38,550 --> 00:12:38,941
Right!

150
00:12:38,965 --> 00:12:40,597
We'll use that gunpowder to blow up the bridge!

151
00:12:40,621 --> 00:12:44,252
What if there are X-Union lookouts at the fort?

152
00:12:45,279 --> 00:12:46,466
Then we'll just drive them off!

153
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:05,721
Now!

154
00:13:17,436 --> 00:13:18,117
Watch out!

155
00:13:20,700 --> 00:13:21,920
W-W-Wait a second...

156
00:13:23,462 --> 00:13:25,037
Whew, thank goodness...

157
00:13:25,061 --> 00:13:26,640
Tink, I took care of them!

158
00:13:26,690 --> 00:13:27,496
Give me a hand!

159
00:13:27,521 --> 00:13:28,333
Okay!

160
00:13:32,999 --> 00:13:37,115
All right! With this much gunpowder, we can blast them with the cannon!

161
00:13:38,089 --> 00:13:40,720
The problem is how to carry all this gunpowder to the bridge.

162
00:13:41,075 --> 00:13:42,700
Hey, I have a great idea!

163
00:13:42,910 --> 00:13:45,337
We can make a pulley and transport it with that.

164
00:14:05,358 --> 00:14:06,459
Speed up!

165
00:14:11,049 --> 00:14:12,141
Giddyup!

166
00:14:15,022 --> 00:14:16,233
Yahoo!

167
00:14:16,404 --> 00:14:18,686
Wheee! Yahoo!

168
00:14:20,639 --> 00:14:23,800
Careful, Tink! Keep jumping around like that and you'll fall off!

169
00:14:31,620 --> 00:14:32,620
Charge!

170
00:14:38,800 --> 00:14:39,960
Oh, it's X!

171
00:14:40,589 --> 00:14:41,459
W-what?

172
00:14:41,748 --> 00:14:42,458
There they are!

173
00:14:49,339 --> 00:14:52,480
Sapphire, watch out! The edges of their skis are blades!

174
00:14:53,425 --> 00:14:54,560
What!?

175
00:15:10,180 --> 00:15:10,720
Oh no!

176
00:15:10,832 --> 00:15:11,832
What's wrong, Sapphire?

177
00:15:11,965 --> 00:15:15,000
The reins have been cut! I can't steer the sled!

178
00:15:16,019 --> 00:15:18,620
I hear Sapphire's voice. Sapphire!

179
00:15:19,814 --> 00:15:20,811
Franz!

180
00:15:21,170 --> 00:15:22,385
Sapphire!

181
00:15:28,681 --> 00:15:30,111
We're going to crash into the bridge!

182
00:15:43,969 --> 00:15:45,258
Tink, are you alright?

183
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,413
Yeah, I'm managing.

184
00:15:50,460 --> 00:15:51,460
Tink!

185
00:15:55,859 --> 00:15:58,579
Sapphire, these guys were guarding the bridge!

186
00:15:58,697 --> 00:15:59,768
 Sapphire!

187
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:00,550
Yes!

188
00:16:13,314 --> 00:16:16,923
The gunpowder fell right into the river! There's nothing we can do! Let's fall back to the fort for now!

189
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:24,283
The fort...

190
00:16:24,408 --> 00:16:25,720
has fallen!

191
00:16:25,744 --> 00:16:27,984
If we go in there, we'll suffer the same fate!

192
00:16:28,009 --> 00:16:29,392
Giddyup!

193
00:16:42,291 --> 00:16:43,564
Fire!

194
00:16:52,353 --> 00:16:54,556
The ravine! If we can make it to that ravine...!

195
00:17:56,591 --> 00:17:59,039
I thought it felt hot—my glove is scorched!

196
00:18:00,809 --> 00:18:03,340
That surface acts just like a lens!

197
00:18:05,229 --> 00:18:07,276
A lens? This is it!

198
00:18:07,529 --> 00:18:08,667
If we use this...

199
00:18:08,691 --> 00:18:11,155
this ravine is narrow and prone to avalanches!

200
00:18:13,259 --> 00:18:15,363
If we can blow up that huge cannon...

201
00:18:16,779 --> 00:18:18,200
The sun is directly overhead, too!

202
00:18:19,519 --> 00:18:21,711
This just might work!

203
00:18:36,009 --> 00:18:39,780
Everyone, split up and hurry! Find the biggest piece of ice you can!

204
00:18:40,660 --> 00:18:41,660
Okay!

205
00:18:42,937 --> 00:18:46,300
If we don't hurry, the cannon will pass through the ravine!

206
00:18:51,639 --> 00:18:54,807
With all this snow, you'd think there'd be ice everywhere,

207
00:18:54,831 --> 00:18:56,025
but when you actually need it...

208
00:18:56,995 --> 00:18:58,125
I can't find any!

209
00:18:59,269 --> 00:19:02,080
What does Sapphire want with ice anyway?

210
00:19:09,299 --> 00:19:12,715
I'm on top of the ice! No, no, no! I'm gonna fall!

211
00:19:13,510 --> 00:19:15,135
Found it! I found it!

212
00:19:18,089 --> 00:19:20,800
Sapphire, aren't you done yet? My hands are freezing!

213
00:19:20,801 --> 00:19:22,178
Just a little more, hang in there!

214
00:19:22,459 --> 00:19:24,960
Sapphire, what are you going to do by carving ice?

215
00:19:25,094 --> 00:19:27,220
A lens! I'm making a giant lens!

216
00:19:41,120 --> 00:19:42,120
Watch out!

217
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:44,153
This ravine is prone to avalanches!

218
00:19:44,280 --> 00:19:46,160
If you fire by mistake, we'll all be wiped out!

219
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:47,356
Listen up!

220
00:19:47,500 --> 00:19:49,977
No matter what happens, under no circumstances are you to fire!

221
00:19:57,752 --> 00:19:58,921
I see! I get it now!

222
00:19:59,289 --> 00:20:01,701
So you're planning to blow up that cannon with this lens?

223
00:20:02,103 --> 00:20:04,271
Exactly! And luckily, look at the sun!

224
00:20:06,469 --> 00:20:08,300
It's on our side!

225
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:15,085
Shine on, sun! Celebrate X-Union's conquest of Silverland!

226
00:20:15,994 --> 00:20:17,283
Behold this power!

227
00:20:18,065 --> 00:20:19,340
This mighty strength!

228
00:20:21,119 --> 00:20:23,600
X-Union shall become the rulers of the world!

229
00:20:30,249 --> 00:20:31,960
Damn it! We missed!

230
00:20:33,609 --> 00:20:36,729
Franz! Hurry! Aim for the fuse!

231
00:20:43,707 --> 00:20:46,335
The enemy is up there! Archers! Archers!

232
00:20:52,235 --> 00:20:54,784
Franz! Watch out! Franz, be careful!

233
00:20:55,244 --> 00:20:57,153
I'm fine, I'm fine! You be careful too!

234
00:20:59,214 --> 00:21:00,680
Oh, just you wait!

235
00:21:07,429 --> 00:21:08,838
Fire! Fire!

236
00:21:20,216 --> 00:21:21,268
The light's reaching the fuse...!

237
00:21:56,476 --> 00:21:59,367
Wh-who did that?! Help!

238
00:22:44,898 --> 00:22:46,476
Tink! Hold on tight!

239
00:22:46,500 --> 00:22:48,882
Sapphire! Don't let go! Hang on!

240
00:23:10,506 --> 00:23:11,271
Franz!

241
00:23:11,943 --> 00:23:12,611
Sapphire!

242
00:23:12,729 --> 00:23:14,348
I'm glad you're okay.. Are you hurt?

243
00:23:15,202 --> 00:23:15,894
Thank you!

244
00:23:16,779 --> 00:23:18,951
By the way, what happened to the cannon? Let's go take a look..

245
00:23:21,873 --> 00:23:22,592
We did it!

246
00:23:22,654 --> 00:23:24,196
The X army is completely wiped out!

247
00:23:24,477 --> 00:23:27,196
The cannon is buried under the snow!

248
00:23:48,724 --> 00:23:52,084
The wounded white eagle vanishes in the power of the sun.

249
00:23:52,108 --> 00:23:55,598
But there is no telling when
the X-Union will attack again.

250
00:23:55,623 --> 00:23:58,363
We must defeat them with our own strength..

251
00:24:21,319 --> 00:24:24,022
No matter what, I must protect this peace...

252
00:24:52,900 --> 00:24:56,520
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

253
00:24:56,521 --> 00:24:59,881
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

254
00:24:59,882 --> 00:25:03,652
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

255
00:25:03,653 --> 00:25:06,814
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

256
00:25:06,815 --> 00:25:10,628
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

257
00:25:10,629 --> 00:25:13,925
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

258
00:25:13,926 --> 00:25:17,931
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if demons come, even if storms arrive,

259
00:25:17,932 --> 00:25:21,370
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

260
00:25:21,371 --> 00:25:24,991
